{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF","remoteSource":{"fileName":"StronglyConnectedComponents.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/StronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L131"},"role":"symbol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"Connectivity"}],"title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","text":"Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm, iterative, O(V + E)."}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"